# Scratch space: asar dumps, npm cache, downloaded tarballs, probe scripts.
# Everything here is regenerable and is deleted before handoff.
.tmp/
.tmp-*
.tmp-analysis/
*.tmp

# Working notes: design records, decision logs, research extracts, handoff
# material. They document one machine's setup and are of no use to anyone
# consuming the theme, so they stay on disk but out of the repository.
docs/

